						<article class="mh-col-1-3 cp-grid-item clearfix post-199779 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-aew-tv-reviews category-mustreadarticles category-newsticker category-tv_reports tag-aew tag-aew-collision tag-aew-dynamite tag-alex-shelley tag-austin-creed tag-bandido tag-brody-king tag-cash-wheeler tag-chris-sabin tag-dax-harwood tag-jay-white tag-jon-moxley tag-kofi tag-kyle-fletcher tag-marina-shafir tag-mercedes-mone tag-mike-bailey tag-stokely-hathaway tag-tommaso-ciampa tag-will-ospreay">
